OL,5,G0630 Breakfast
OL,6,     FTom McKinney presents Radio 3's
OL,7,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,8,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,9,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,10,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,11,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,12,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,13,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,14,     Ffavourites.
OL,15,G1300 Classical Live
OL,16,     FAlex Humphreys introduces an
OL,17,     Fafternoon of great music-making
OL,18,     Fincluding highlights from the
OL,19,     FBaltic Sea Festival and chamber
OL,20,     Fmusic from the East Neuk Festival.
