OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Venetian
OL,6,G     School
OL,7,     F2/5. Donald Macleod examines the
OL,8,     Finfluence of St Mark on the music
OL,9,     Fof the Venetian School.
OL,10,G1700 In Tune
OL,11,     FViolinist Liya Petrova performs
OL,12,     Flive in 80A. Sir Mark Elder joins
OL,13,     FKatie Derham in studio to discuss
OL,14,     Fconducting the Orchestra of the
OL,15,     FAge if Enlightenment in Bizet's
OL,16,     FL'Arlesienne.
